<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδακρ-ύω</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῦ</span>],
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weep much for, lament
				loudly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
				</span></i>
			<i>Phd..</i><i><span class="en">
				116d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γνώμην</span>
			<i>weep away</i> one's judgement, <i>be melted to tears contrary
				to</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				983
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be made to weep</i> by the use of collyrium, and so
			<i>have</i> the eyes <i>purged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				958b6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.751
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of trees,
				<i>weep, drip</i> gum, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ῥητίνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.640d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cease to weep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολοφυράμενοι καὶ ἀποδακρύσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristox.
					<u>Fr.Hist.</u>
					90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				427
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
